Copyright (c) 2026 abuzar310, MIT licence (see LICENSE).

Pickup Log is a new WebAssembly mod written for Horizon's current mod SDK. Its idea follows:

- "Pick Up Notifier" by DeportedToHell, a port for Horizon's earlier mod system
  (https://github.com/DeportedToHell/MCRE-Mods/tree/main/pickupnotifier, Mozilla Public License 2.0),
  archived in the Horizon mod registry as archive/native-v1/mods/pickupnotifier.toml;
- which ports Pick Up Notifier by Fuzs (https://github.com/Fuzss/pickupnotifier, Mozilla Public
  License 2.0).

No source code, assets or other files of either project are included in or copied into Pickup Log,
so this notice is a credit only; it does not place Pickup Log under the MPL-2.0.
